('How to Top Up WePlay Coins in India: 2026 Updated Guide', 'how-to-top-up-weplay-coins-india-2026', 'A step-by-step tutorial on recharging WePlay coins using UPI and Razorpay at the lowest prices.', 'Recharging WePlay coins in India has never been easier. Step 1: Visit LowestWeplay.shop. Step 2: Choose your desired coin pack. Step 3: Enter your WePlay ID and Name. Step 4: Pay securely via UPI. Step 5: Receive your coins instantly. Our prices are up to 70% cheaper than in-app purchases.', 'Guides', 'Admin', '{"Guide", "Recharge", "Coins"}');
